[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0029","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10092","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_proxy 跨站点脚本漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.4.0 至 2.4.39 版本中 mod_proxy 模块的错误页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。当服务器配置了代理功能且存在错误配置时，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的请求，使代理错误页面中的链接指向攻击者控制的恶意页面，从而在用户浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞利用需要用户交互（点击恶意链接），影响范围限于启用了代理功能的 Apache HTTP Server 部署环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10092"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-26T16:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:10:12Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.41 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mod_proxy 错误页面的 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 mod_proxy 模块或修改配置移除 ProxyErrorOverride 指令，并在反向代理后端对用户输入进行 HTML 编码过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-09/msg00004.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/08/15/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2020/08/08/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2020/08/08/9","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:4126","https://github.com/DrunkenShells/Disclosures/tree/master/CVE-2019-10092-Limited%20Cross-Site%20Scripting%20in%20mod_proxy%20Error%20Page-Apache%20httpd","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/56c2e7cc9deb1c12a843d0dc251ea7fd3e7e80293cde02fcd65286ba%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/73768e31e0fcae03e12f5aa87da1cb26dece39327f3c32060baa3e94%40%3Cannounce.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r03ee478b3dda3e381fd6189366fa7af97c980d2f602846eef935277d%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r06f0d87ebb6d59ed8379633f36f72f5b1f79cadfda72ede0830b42cf%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0a83b112cd9701ef8a2061c8ed557f3dc9bb774d4da69fbb91bbc3c4%40%3Cusers.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r3c5c3104813c1c5508b55564b66546933079250a46ce50eee90