且指向自身），或对重定向目标 URL 进行严格的换行符过滤校验，确保 RewriteRule 的替换字符串中不包含未转义的 %0d%0a 编码序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2020/04/01/4","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r03ee478b3dda3e381fd6189366fa7af97c980d2f602846eef935277d%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r06f0d87ebb6d59ed8379633f36f72f5b1f79cadfda72ede0830b42cf%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r3c5c3104813c1c5508b55564b66546933079250a46ce50eee90b2e36%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5d12ffc80685b0df1d6801e68000a7707dd694fe32e4f221de67c210%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r76142b8c5119df2178be7c2dba88fde552eedeec37ea993dfce68d1d%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rc998b18880df98bafaade071346690c2bc1444adaa1a1ea464b93f0a%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rd18c3c43602e66f9cdcf09f1de233804975b9572b0456cc582390b6f%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rd2fb621142e7fa187cfe12d7137bf66e7234abcbbcd800074c84a538%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/re3d27b6250aa8548b8845d314bb8a350b3df326cacbbfdfe4d455234%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuApr2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2020.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2020.html","https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2019-5072832.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47689","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10098.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10098.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-10098.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/apache/http_server/CVE-2019-10098.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-10098.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10098.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-10098.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2019-10098.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/334b2fb23901277637625149d9457e1953ae2edd/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-10098.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/334b2fb23901277637625149d9457e1953ae2edd/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2019-10098.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10098.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0035","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10405","title":"Jenkins 2.196 及更早版本 /whoAmI/ 跨站脚本攻击","description":"Jenkins 2.196及之前版本、LTS 2.176.3及之前版本的/whoAmI/诊断页面存在信息泄露漏洞。该页面会直接输出HTTP请求中Cookie头的明文值，即使Cookie设置了HttpOnly标记也无法阻止其被泄露。已登录的低权限远程攻击者可利用其他跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞诱导用户访问该页面，从而窃取会话Cookie实现会话劫持，导致敏感信息泄露和未授权操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10405"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-25T16:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:10:52Z","remediation":"立即将 Jenkins 升级到 2.197（每周版）或 2.176.4/2.190.1（LTS 版）及以上版本。该版本已移除 /whoAmI/ 页面中 Cookie HTTP 请求头的明文输出，防止攻击者通过 XSS 窃取 HttpOnly 标记的会话 Cookie。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）配置规则阻止对 /whoAmI/ 路径的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/09/25/3","https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2019-09-25/#SECURITY-1505","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10405.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10405.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10405.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-10405.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-10405-3707.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-10405-3708.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-10405-3706.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-10405/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-10405.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Jenkins/CVE-2019-10405.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/jenkins/CVE-2019-10405.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10405.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0035.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0808","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16759","title":"vBulletin 5.x widgetConfig 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2019-16759是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16759"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-24T22:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:44Z","remediation":"立即将 vBulletin 升级至 5.5.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 widgetConfig[code] 参数远程代码执行漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中拦截对 ajax/render/widget_php 路径的访问，并限制管理后台仅允许可信 IP 访问。升级前务必备份论坛数据库和文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154623/vBulletin-5.x-0-Day-Pre-Auth-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154648/vBulletin-5.x-Pre-Auth-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155633/vBulletin-5.5.4-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158829/vBulletin-5.x-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158830/vBulletin-5.x-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158866/vBulletin-5.x-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Aug/5","https://arstechnica.com/information-technology/2019/09/public-exploit-code-spawns-mass-attacks-against-high-severity-vbulletin-bug/","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Sep/31","https://www.theregister.co.uk/2019/09/24/vbulletin_vbug_zeroday/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-16759","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47437","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16759.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16759.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/6602db50598d0ed3bff77588ae1140dbe71a025c/web/CVE-2019-16759 vBulletin 5.x 0day pre-auth RCE exploit.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd