rces":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-23T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:28Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 9 月安全更新 KB4522007（Internet Explorer 累积安全更新），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。该更新覆盖 Windows 7/8.1/10、Windows Server 2008/2012/2012 R2 及嵌入式版本上的 IE 9/10/11。如无法立即打补丁，可启用 Microsoft EMET 或 Windows Defender Application Guard 作为临时缓解措施，并限制用户仅访问受信任网站以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1367","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1367","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1367.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-1367.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-1367.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1367.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1367.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1367.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-13679.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-1367.json","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2019/CVE-2019-1367.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md","https://github.com/mandarenmanman/CVE-2019-1367"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0509.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0509.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0105","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16525","title":"WordPress checklist 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"CVE-2019-16525是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16525"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-19T20:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:21Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress 的 checklist 插件至 1.1.9 或更高版本，以修复 checklist-icon.php 中 fill 参数的 XSS 过滤缺陷。如暂时无法升级，可在 WordPress 主题的 functions.php 中通过钩子对该参数实施输入过滤，使用 esc_html 或 sanitize_text_field 对用户输入进行转义，同时在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中配置规则拦截包含 &lt;script&gt; 标签的请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154436/WordPress-Checklist-1.1.5-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/2155029/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/checklist/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9877","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16525.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16525.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16525.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-16525.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16525-3935.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16525-3937.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16525-3938.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-16525.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-16525.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-16525.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16525.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0103","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16332","title":"WordPress api-bearer-auth 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 api-bearer-auth 插件在 2019 年 9 月 7 日之前的版本中，swagger-config.yaml.php 文件对 server 参数缺乏有效过滤，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的请求参数实施跨站脚本（XSS）攻击。该漏洞影响使用该插件的 WordPress 网站，攻击者成功利用后可在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本代码，窃取敏感信息或劫持用户会话。攻击者需诱使用户点击特制链接或访问恶意页面才能触发漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16332"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-15T22:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:08Z","remediation":"将 api-bearer-auth 插件升级至 20190907 或更高版本，该版本已对 swagger-config.yaml.php 文件中的 server 参数进行输入过滤，修复了 XSS 漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用该插件的 Swagger 功能或通过 Web 服务器配置限制对 swagger-config.yaml.php 的直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154369/WordPress-API-Bearer-Auth-20181229-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/2152730","https://wordpress.org/plugins/api-bearer-auth/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9868","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16332.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16332.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16332.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-16332.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16332-3931.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16332-3933.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16332-3934.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-16332.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-16332.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-16332.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16332.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0102","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16313","title":"蜂网互联 企业级路由器 凭据泄露漏洞","description":"蜂网互联（ifw8）企业级路由器 ROM v4.31 存在凭据泄露漏洞，其 Web 管理接口中的 action/usermanager.htm 页面未做任何访问权限控制，导致页面 HTML 源码中明文硬编码了管理员账号密码（CWE-798）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标设备发送一次 HTTP GET 请求即可直接访问该页面，通过解析响应源码中的 pwd 字段提取明文密码，进而完全接管路由器管理权限。该漏洞影响所有运行 v4.31 固件的 ifw8 FR6 系列企业级路由器，攻击条件极低，无需登录凭证、无需用户交互，网络可达即可利用，CVSS v3.1 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16313"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-14T16:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:06Z","remediation":"联系蜂网互联（ifw8）官方技术支持获取修复该漏洞的最新固件版本并升级。在官方固件发布前，建议在防火墙或访问控制列表中限制路由器管理界面仅允许可信 IP 地址访问，修改默认管理员密码为高强度密码，并通过反向代理或 WAF 规则拦截对 /action/usermanager.htm 的外部直接访问请求，以临时缓解凭据泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iwantacve.cn/index.php/archives/311/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16313.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16313.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2019/CVE-2019-16313.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-16313.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16313-3928.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16313-3926.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16313-3929.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/ifw8/CVE-2019-16313.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/网络设备漏洞/蜂网互联 企业级路由器v4.31 密码泄露漏洞 CVE-2019-16313.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16313.yaml","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/iot/蜂网互联/蜂网互联 企业级路由器v4.31 密码泄露漏洞 CVE-2019-16313.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0102.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0709","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16256","title":"Samsung S@T浏览器（SIMalliance Toolbox Browser）远程代码执行漏洞","description":"三星部分设备在 UICC 智能卡上集成了 SIMalliance Toolbox Browser（即 S@T Browser），该组件在解析通过 SMS 短信发送的 SIM Toolkit（STK）指令时存在安全缺陷，即\"Simjacker\"漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标设备发送包含恶意 STK 指令的短信，在无需用户交互的前提下触发该缺陷，从而检索设备的地理位置信息和 IMEI 标识，甚至可读取其他敏感数据或执行特定指令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级为严重，主要影响使用三星 UICC 相关组件并通过运营商短信通道传播攻击场景的移动设备。厂商建议用户及时安装系统更新并警惕来自未知号码的短信。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16256"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-12T13:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:00Z","remediation":"tags. The user says \"你可以先简要分析，但最终答案必须放在一对 <value>...","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.adaptivemobile.com/blog/simjacker-next-generation-spying-over-mobile","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-16256","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-16256.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-16256.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-16256.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-162xx/CVE-2019-16256.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/13889512387aab8222dfb3d51d4f65251575a372/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-16256","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-16256.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/af4c3baed89cca1eaf817627cdf97ed20b01972b/2019/CVE-2019-16256/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/af4c3baed89cca1eaf817627cdf97ed20b01972b/2019/CVE-2019-16256/README_KO.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2019/CVE-2019-16256.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2019/CVE-2019-16256.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0406","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1297","title":"Microsoft Excel 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 在处理内存对象时存在远程代码执行漏洞，当软件未能正确验证内存中的对象时，攻击者可利用特制的 Excel 文件触发该漏洞。攻击者需通过社会工程手段诱导用户打开恶意文件，成功利用后可获取与当前用户相同的系统权限，实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2010/2013/2016 及 Office 365 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 9 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1297"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-11T22:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:19Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 9 月安全更新：Excel 2010 安装 KB4475579，Excel 2013 安装 KB4475578，Excel 2016 安装 KB4475577，Office 2019 及 Office 365 ProPlus 通过 Microsoft Update 自动更新至最新版本。Mac 版 Office 2016/2019 通过 AutoUpdate 检查更新。如无法立即打补丁，可配置组策略禁用从不受信任来源打开 Excel 文件，并启用受保护视图和文件阻止功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1297","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1297","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1297.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1297.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12973.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12970.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12971.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12972.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-1297.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/cb0b6a42cd6b56fad8905ad055f6fd839697b5f2/2019/CVE-2019-1297/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/cb0b6a42cd6b56fad8905ad055f6fd839697b5f2/2019/CVE-2019-1297/README_KO.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2019/CVE-2019-1297.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0400","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1253","title":"Microsoft Windows AppX Deployment Server 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows AppX 部署服务器（AppXSvc）在处理符号链接（junctions）时存在权限提升漏洞。由于该服务未能正确验证符号链接的目标路径，允许低权限攻击者在已获得系统执行权限后，通过创建恶意符号链接指向高权限可访问的文件或注册表项，从而将自身权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本，攻击者需先获得目标系统的低权限代码执行能力方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1253"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-11T22:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 9 月安全更新（对应 KB4515384 及后续累积更新），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取。受影响版本包括 Windows 10 1703/1709/1803/1809/1903 及 Windows Server 1803/1903/2019。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制低权限用户本地登录，并监控 AppXSvc 对符号链接的异常操作行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154488/AppXSvc-17763.1.amd64fre.rs5_release.180914-1434-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1253","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1253","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46963","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47389","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1253.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-1253/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-1253/README_EN.md","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2019-1253.cs","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2019-1253/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1253.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1303.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1278.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1253.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12538.md","https://github.com/padovah4ck/CVE-2019-1253","https://github.com/rogue-kdc/CVE-2019-1253","https://github.com/sgabe/CVE-2019-1253","https://github.com/tarantula-team/CVE-2019-12538","https://github.com/offsec-ttps/CVE2019-1253-Compiled"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0400.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0400.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0333","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1215","title":"Microsoft Windows ws2ifsl.sys 特权提升漏洞","description":"CVE-2019-1215 是 Windows 套接字驱动 ws2ifsl.sys（Winsock）中的释放后使用漏洞。本地低权限攻击者可通过特制系统调用触发已释放内存对象的访问，在内核上下文中执行任意代码，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10 及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。已有公开的利用代码（ExploitDB 47935）可绕过 kASLR、kCFG 和 SMEP 等内核缓解措施。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 9 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1215"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-11T22:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:05Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 9 月安全更新（适用于 Windows 7 SP1/8.1/10 及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 各版本），通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。该漏洞已有公开利用代码（ExploitDB 47935）且被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，无法立即打补丁时应限制本地用户登录权限并启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少（ASR）规则作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1215","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1215","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47935","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1215.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-1215.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-1215/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-1215/README_EN.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1215.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1303.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1278.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1215.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12157.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12156.md","https://github.com/bluefrostsecurity/CVE-2019-1215"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0016","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1214","title":"Microsoft Windows 通用日志文件系统驱动程序权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 通用日志文件系统（CLFS）驱动程序存在内存对象处理不当的权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上运行特制应用程序触发该漏洞，获得 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码，实现完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Windows 7 至 Windows 10 及 Windows Server 2008 R2 至 Server 2019 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无需用户交互即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1214"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-11T22:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:05Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2019 年 9 月安全更新（Windows 10 1903 对应 KB4515384，1809 对应 KB4512578，1803 对应 KB4512501，Windows 7/8.1 对应 KB4512486），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。无法立即打补丁时，限制低权限用户登录受影响的系统作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1214","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1214","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1214.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1214.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1214.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12147.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12148.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-1214.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-1214.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-1214.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-1214.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2019/CVE-2019-1214.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0101","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16123","title":"Kartatopia PilusCart 路径遍历漏洞","description":"PilusCart 是 Kartatopia 开发的一款基于 PHP 的电子商务软件。该软件在 catalog.php 页面的 filename 参数处理上存在路径遍历漏洞，由于未对用户输入的 filename 参数进行有效过滤，攻击者可通过注入 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞影响 PilusCart 1.4.1 及以下所有版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用。攻击者只需构造类似 `catalog.php?filename=../../../../../../../../../etc/passwd` 的 GET 请求，即可泄露服务器敏感配置文件或系统文件，严重时可导致信息泄露并为进一步攻击提供数据支撑。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16123"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-09T02:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:42Z","remediation":"建议升级到 PilusCart 1.4.2 或更高版本以修复该路径遍历漏洞。若暂无官方补丁版本，可手动修改 catalog.php 代码，对 filename 参数使用 basename() 过滤或正则白名单验证，禁止传入 ../ 等目录遍历字符；同时可在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层配置规则，拦截包含 ../ 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47315","https://zerodays.lol/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16123.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16123.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16123.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-16123.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16123-3918.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16123-3917.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16123-3916.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16123-3914.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2019-16123.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/PilusCart/CVE-2019-16123.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16123.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0098","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16097","title":"Harbor 镜像仓库未授权创建管理员账户漏洞","description":"Harbor 容器镜像仓库在 core/api/user.go 中存在权限校验缺失漏洞。当 Harbor 以数据库认证后端（DB auth）运行且开放用户自注册时，低权限非管理员用户可通过向 POST /api/users API 发送请求创建管理员账户，实现未授权权限提升。该漏洞影响 Harbor 1.7.0 至 1.8.2 版本，攻击者仅需具备普通注册用户身份即可在无需交互的情况下完成利用，成功后可完全接管 Harbor 管理控制台，窃取镜像仓库数据、删除仓库或实施供应链攻击。修复方案为升级至 v1.7.6、v1.8.3 或 v1.9.0 版本；临时缓解措施可将认证后端切换为 LDAP 等非数据库认证方式。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16097"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-08T16:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:39Z","remediation":"立即将 Harbor 升级至修复版本：运行 1.7.x 的用户升级到 v1.7.6，运行 1.8.x 的用户升级到 v1.8.3 或更高版本（v1.9.0+ 不受影响）。如暂时无法升级，可将认证后端从 DB 切换为 LDAP 等非数据库认证方式，并禁用用户自注册功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2019-0015.html","https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/commit/b6db8a8a106259ec9a2c48be8a380cb3b37cf517","https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/compare/v1.8.2...v1.9.0-rc1","https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/releases/tag/v1.7.6","https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/releases/tag/v1.8.3","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/critical-vulnerability-in-harbor-enables-privilege-escalation-from-zero-to-admin-cve-2019-16097/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16097.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16097.md","https://github.com/coffeehb/Some-PoC-oR-ExP/blob/29c28c6af8cd